---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/site/PageHero.astro";
import Icon from "../../components/ui/Icon.astro";
import { AUDIENCES, AUDIENCE_INFO } from "../../data/taxonomy";
import { CONTACT, AUTHOR } from "../../data/contact";
import { SITE } from "../../data/site";
import { allChapters, allTools, allTerms, roleJds, breadcrumbLd } from "../../lib/library";
import type { IconName } from "../../lib/icons";
import portrait from "../../assets/akash-mukundan.jpg";

const [chapters, tools, terms, jds] = await Promise.all([allChapters(), allTools(), allTerms(), roleJds()]);
const trail = [
  { name: "Library", href: "/" },
  { name: "About", href: "/about/" }
];
const wa = CONTACT.whatsapp ? `https://wa.me/${CONTACT.whatsapp}?text=${encodeURIComponent("Hi Akash, I have a question about PeopleCraft.")}` : "";
const ld = [
  breadcrumbLd(Astro.site, trail),
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "AboutPage",
    name: "About PeopleCraft",
    url: new URL("/about/", Astro.site).toString(),
    mainEntity: {
      "@type": "Organization",
      name: SITE.name,
      url: new URL("/", Astro.site).toString(),
      logo: new URL("/icons/icon-512.png", Astro.site).toString(),
      founder: { "@type": "Person", name: AUTHOR.name, jobTitle: AUTHOR.role, sameAs: [AUTHOR.linkedin] },
      sameAs: [CONTACT.linkedin].filter(Boolean)
    }
  }
];
---

<BaseLayout title="About PeopleCraft" description="PeopleCraft is a free HR library for India built by Akash Mukundan, an HR business partner in Bengaluru. No sign-up, no paywall, no tracking." jsonLd={ld}>
  <PageHero title="About PeopleCraft" lede="A free HR library for India, written in plain English for everyone who works: the people who run HR, the founders who hire, the employees who get paid, and the students about to start." trail={trail} />

  <div class="wrap section about">
    <section class="author" aria-labelledby="author-name">
      <figure class="portrait">
        <span class="tape t1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="tape t2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <Picture src={portrait} formats={["avif", "webp"]} widths={[280, 560]} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 9rem, 14rem" alt="Akash Mukundan" class="photo" loading="eager" />
        <figcaption class="hand">Akash, Bengaluru</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="who">
        <p class="small muted">Built by</p>
        <h2 id="author-name">{AUTHOR.name}</h2>
        <p class="role">{AUTHOR.role}</p>
        <ul class="creds" aria-label="Credentials">
          {AUTHOR.credentials.map((c) => <li class="chip">{c}</li>)}
        </ul>
        <div class="links">
          {
            AUTHOR.linkedin && (
              <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href={AUTHOR.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <Icon name="external-link" size={16} />
                LinkedIn
              </a>
            )
          }
          {
            CONTACT.email && (
              <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>
                <Icon name="mail" size={16} />
                Email
              </a>
            )
          }
          {
            wa && (
              <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <Icon name="message" size={16} />
                WhatsApp
              </a>
            )
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="prose story">
      <p class="first">
        PeopleCraft exists because there was no single place that brought together Indian labour law, HR tools, compliance references and workforce analytics, without a paywall or a sales pitch.
      </p>
      <p>
        Akash has spent more than five years in HR across healthcare, aerospace, retail and technology: from psychiatric hospitals with NABH compliance to aerospace companies with DGCA and AS9100D
        audits. The same problem kept coming back. Checking a Labour Code provision, working out gratuity, drafting a JD or building an org chart for a leadership review meant searching late at
        night and stitching together sources that were often out of date.
      </p>
      <p>
        Enterprise HR platforms are priced for very large companies. The free material was scattered and still stuck before the Labour Codes. There was nothing in between for the working HR
        professional, the founder or the employee, so he built it.
      </p>
      <p>
        The labour law chapters draw on audits he has prepared for. The recruitment material comes from hiring more than 255 people across engineering, clinical and retail roles. The analytics
        tool exists because he was tired of rebuilding the same dashboard at every new company. And it is free, because basic HR knowledge in India shouldn't sit behind enterprise pricing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="facts" role="group" aria-label="What's in the library">
      <p><strong>{chapters.length}</strong> handbook chapters</p>
      <p><strong>{tools.length}</strong> tools</p>
      {jds.length > 0 && <p><strong>{jds.length}</strong> job descriptions</p>}
      <p><strong>{terms.length}</strong> glossary terms</p>
    </div>

    <section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-h">
      <h2 id="principles-h">What PeopleCraft promises</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <Icon name="lock" size={22} />
          <div>
            <h3>Private by design</h3>
            <p>No login, no tracking and no data collection. Every tool runs in your browser, so employee data, salaries and org charts stay on your device.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="map-pin" size={22} />
          <div>
            <h3>Built for India</h3>
            <p>Written from the Labour Codes, Indian payroll and Indian HR practice up, not a global product with an India chapter.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="heart" size={22} />
          <div>
            <h3>Free, all of it</h3>
            <p>No paid tier and nothing to unlock. Every chapter, tool and template is free to use and adapt.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="stamp" size={22} />
          <div>
            <h3>Checked, not guessed</h3>
            <p>Every rule and number links to the law or notice it comes from, with the date it was last checked. <a href="/about/how-we-check/">How facts are checked</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>How it's made</h2>
      <p>
        PeopleCraft is built by one person using AI as a force multiplier: the site and much of the first drafting were done with Claude, Anthropic's AI model. That is why every legal fact is checked
        against official sources and dated, and why each page lists the sources it relies on.
      </p>

      <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    </div>

    <ul class="readers">
      {
        AUDIENCES.map((a) => (
          <li>
            <a href={AUDIENCE_INFO[a].path}>
              <Icon name={AUDIENCE_INFO[a].icon as IconName} size={20} />
              <span>
                <strong>{AUDIENCE_INFO[a].label}</strong>
                <span class="small muted">{AUDIENCE_INFO[a].blurb}</span>
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What it isn't</h2>
      <p>
        PeopleCraft is general information, not legal, tax or financial advice, and it is not a certification. Your contract, your company's policy, your state's rules or a recent notification can change the
        answer for you. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Talk to us</h2>
      <p>Spotted something wrong or out of date? Want a tool that isn't here yet? Corrections are checked against the source and fixed on the page.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact">
      {
        wa && (
          <a class="btn" href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <Icon name="message" size={18} />
            Message on WhatsApp
          </a>
        )
      }
      {
        CONTACT.email && (
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>
            <Icon name="mail" size={18} />
            {CONTACT.email}
          </a>
        )
      }
      {
        CONTACT.linkedin && (
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={CONTACT.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <Icon name="external-link" size={18} />
            PeopleCraft on LinkedIn
          </a>
        )
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 50rem;
    padding-bottom: var(--section);
  }
  .author {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 14rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  /* A print taped into the notebook, captioned by hand. */
  .portrait {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px 10px 2.4rem;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgb(17 20 58 / 0.06),
      2px 3px 0 rgb(17 20 58 / 0.08),
      8px 16px 28px -14px rgb(17 20 58 / 0.4);
  }
  .portrait :global(.photo) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 1px;
    outline: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
    outline-offset: -1px;
  }
  .portrait figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0.45rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
  .portrait .tape {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 4.2rem;
    height: 1.3rem;
    background: rgb(255 227 110 / 0.62);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(17 20 58 / 0.14);
  }
  .portrait .t1 {
    top: -0.5rem;
    left: -1.1rem;
    transform: rotate(-38deg);
  }
  .portrait .t2 {
    top: -0.5rem;
    right: -1.1rem;
    transform: rotate(36deg);
    background: rgb(191 224 255 / 0.65);
  }
  .who {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    align-content: center;
  }
  .who h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    font-stretch: 106%;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .role {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-weight: 560;
  }
  .creds {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .links {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .story .first {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9rem, 1fr));
    border-block: 2px solid var(--neel-700);
  }
  .facts p {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1rem 1.1rem 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
  }
  .facts strong {
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    font-stretch: 106%;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--neel-700);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .principles h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .principles ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 20rem), 1fr));
    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .principles li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .principles li > :global(svg) {
    color: var(--neel-600);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
  .principles h3 {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
  }
  .principles p {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
  }
  .principles a {
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .readers {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 17rem), 1fr));
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .readers a {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .readers a:hover {
    border-color: var(--neel-300);
    background: var(--canvas);
  }
  .readers :global(svg) {
    color: var(--neel-600);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .readers a > span {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .author {
      grid-template-columns: 9rem 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .author {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .portrait {
      width: 11rem;
    }
  }
</style>
